---
---

<section id="about" class="relative py-32">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Visual Side -->
      <div class="relative reveal-left">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 gradient-bg rounded-3xl blur-3xl opacity-20"></div>
        <div class="relative glass-strong rounded-3xl p-8 hover-lift">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8">
            <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl gradient-bg flex items-center justify-center text-3xl font-bold font-display">
              BA
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Bayu Andika</h3>
              <p class="text-white/50 text-sm">Multidisciplinary Professional</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 11V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4M5 9h14l1 12H4L5 9z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="font-medium">Store Operation</p>
                <p class="text-white/50 text-sm mt-1">Manajemen operasional toko yang efisien dan terstruktur</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-pink-500/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-pink-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="font-medium">Service Advisor</p>
                <p class="text-white/50 text-sm mt-1">Konsultasi dan layanan pelanggan yang prima</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z"/>
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="font-medium">Stamping Press Operator</p>
                <p class="text-white/50 text-sm mt-1">Ahli dalam operasional mesin press dan kontrol kualitas</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Stats -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-white/10">
            <div class="text-center">
              <p class="font-display text-3xl font-bold gradient-text">3+</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-white/50 mt-1">Profesi</p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
              <p class="font-display text-3xl font-bold gradient-text">5+</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-white/50 mt-1">Proyek</p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
              <p class="font-display text-3xl font-bold gradient-text">100%</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-white/50 mt-1">Dedikasi</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text Side -->
      <div class="reveal-right">
        <p class="text-indigo-400 font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-sm mb-4">Tentang Saya</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-8">
          Multidisciplinary<br />
          <span class="gradient-text">Professional</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-white/60 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Saya adalah profesional multitalenta dengan pengalaman di tiga bidang utama: 
            <span class="text-white font-medium">Store Operation</span>, 
            <span class="text-white font-medium">Service Advisor</span>, dan 
            <span class="text-white font-medium">Stamping Press Operator</span>.
          </p>
          <p>
            Dengan pemahaman mendalam tentang operasional bisnis, layanan pelanggan, 
            dan proses manufaktur, saya mampu menggabungkan pengetahuan industri 
            dengan keterampilan teknologi modern untuk menciptakan solusi yang efisien dan inovatif.
          </p>
          <p>
            Saya percaya bahwa presisi, ketelitian, dan pelayanan terbaik adalah kunci 
            keberhasilan dalam setiap bidang pekerjaan. Prinsip ini saya terapkan 
            dalam setiap proyek yang saya kerjakan.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Key Points -->
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-10">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-green-500/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-green-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-white/70">Orientasi Detail</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-green-500/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-green-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-white/70">Pelayanan Prima</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-green-500/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-green-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-white/70">Presisi Tinggi</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-green-500/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-green-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-white/70">Adaptif & Cepat Belajar</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
